      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but those feel a bit like surface-level reasons. i'm looking for more of the deep philosophical or legal arguments. like, what do the people who are really serious about this say regarding things like legal liability or the concept of collective vs individual responsibility? i want to make sure i'm not just characterizing them as being against it for the sake of it, but actually understanding their logic.",
